@* The orbital data notice for the Observatory pass area. It describes the snapshot installed now, through the shared
   compact notice and its one freshness rule. It passes nothing to the pass planner, so a completed search keeps the
   snapshot it was computed from. *@
@if (_loaded)
{
    <div class="observatory-orbital-notice" role="group" aria-labelledby="observatory-orbital-notice-label">
        <p id="observatory-orbital-notice-label" class="observatory-orbital-notice-label">Orbital data installed now. A completed pass search keeps the snapshot it was computed from.</p>
        <OrbitalDataStatusNotice View="_view" Id="observatory-orbital-data-notice" />
    </div>
}
